    at: 'tehran',
    title: 'The IRGC and the clerics',
    text: () => 'Mojtaba Khamenei owes his seat to the Guards, and the Guards want it paid: the economy, the foreign ministry, the succession council. The senior clergy in Qom are quietly asking whether the new Leader is a Leader at all.',
