    text: (h) => `Your forces hold ground east of the Euphrates. The SDF has pulled guards off the al-Hol and Ghweiran detention sites; ${h.w.isisStrength >= 45 ? 'ISIS cells are already probing the wire.' : 'Washington is threatening sanctions over the detainees.'}`,
