    text: (h) => `Mazloum Abdi will integrate his brigades as units of the Syrian army, with Kurdish officers and the oil revenue shared. ${h.infOf('neSyria', 'us') >= 15 ? 'The Americans are guaranteeing the talks.' : 'With the Americans gone, he has less to bargain with every week.'} Ankara wants the brigades broken up, not integrated.`,
